license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >-
  V2VA aligns the embedding space of a 3D ViT encoder with the volumetric space of
  the input. JEPA-style self-supervised pretraining learns the volume-to-token
  direction; the classification head applies the reverse token-to-volume direction
  by re-folding encoder tokens [B, N, E] into a voxel grid classified by a residual
  3D CNN. Accepted at PRICAI 2026; the official proceedings are not published yet.
keywords:
  - self-supervised learning
  - medical imaging
  - 3D vision transformer
  - V-JEPA
  - MedMNIST
